Every record carries `raster` + top-level `gate_snn` + `gate_compute`. Windows {wins[0]:.0f}/{wins[1]:.0f}/{wins[2]:.0f} ms; `window_s == window_ms/1000` exactly; `spikes == round(neurons·rate·window_s)` with zero slack ({n_sp[0]}/{n_sp[1]}/{n_sp[2]} at {rates[0]}/{rates[1]}/{rates[2]} Hz over {n_neu[0]}/{n_neu[1]}/{n_neu[2]} neurons); `energy_pJ = spikes·23` and `energy_uJ = spikes·23e-6` exact ({n_sp[0]*23}/{n_sp[1]*23}/{n_sp[2]*23} pJ). Routing source/target + 3-entry tables + `third_factor` on all three (modulators {tfs[0]} / {tfs[1]} / {tfs[2]}; τe {taus[0]}/{taus[1]}/{taus[2]} s as consistent `tau_e_s`+`tau_e_ms` pairs). Excerpts integer `t_us`, in-window, `neuron_id`-bounded, sorted, full-window by construction, per-spike amplitude with adaptation (0.82**k) plus noise. ISI histograms from the full window, bins ≥1 ms, counts sum to `spikes − distinct_active_neurons` ({isis[0]}/{isis[1]}/{isis[2]}). Same-neuron gaps ≥1100 µs pre-round, ≥1000 µs serialized. `gate_snn` on all three: decisions REJECT/MODIFY/ACCEPT matching each lead trajectory; every rate-declaring population's budget exact against its decision window. `gate_compute.per_check` windows 32–40 ms, budgets exact ({gc[0]} / {gc[1]} / {gc[2]}). Main streams: {events[0]}/{events[1]}/{events[2]} events (inside the 5–40 cap), strictly increasing `t_rel_ms` only (no `t_ms` mix), same-channel refractory ≥0.8 ms (184 DO pair at 1.3 ms, 185 pellistor pair at 1.2 ms, 186 radar pair at 1.5 ms).

## Self-critique

### Edge cases added vs still thin
- **Added:** first Stern-Volmer luminescence-quenching dissolved-oxygen family on a WWTP aeration basin with a recomputable DO=k_sv·(τ0/τ−1) (`2.00 ppm`) plus quenching and product identities and three-party collusion including the DO infra owner; first catalytic-bead pellistor LEL family on a solvent-recovery oven with recomputable LEL=k_p·(I−I0) (`12.00 %LEL`) and bridge-delta identity, plus a resolved-innocent pellistor tech (timezone-skipped bead-zero, not last-to-badge); first free-space FMCW tank-radar remaining-level family on a crude atmospheric still with recomputable L=k_r·Δf (`12.00 m`) plus sweep identity; bounded ACCEPT whose out-of-scope clause is adjacent stills rather than a hopper/taphole/dump cap; operational t2 on all three (blower-hold, new-bead restart, skip-still refusal); provenance trio designed/hil/simulated; 18 min / 24 min / 12 min slow floors in-stream.
- **Still thin:** (i) 184's k_sv is a lumped Stern-Volmer constant, not a temperature / fouling table — a 8 K basin hop that fakes 2.00 ppm inside a 6.40 Sternveil corridor is unwritten; (ii) 185's k_p is a lumped bead gain, not a poison / O2-deficiency map, so a silicone-poison hop that fakes 12.00 %LEL is unwritten; (iii) 186's k_r is a lumped chirp-to-range gain, not a dielectric / foam-layer map, so a foam hop that fakes 12.00 m inside a 4.80 last-good is unwritten; (iv) vendor-only as a *lead* REJECT on a plant with *no* independent optode/pellistor/radar installed yet remains slightly harder — 184/185 still have plant heads; (v) stream amplitudes remain authored constants (raster draws are the only seeded noise); (vi) r56 densification leftovers (IRIS c(T), slag-window pyrometer, OIW quenching) were left for that round's owner.

### Realism of noise / temporal fidelity
- Strong: 184's 2.00 ppm, Q 0.50, product 32.00, and 18.0 min blower-hold (`6000+1080=7080 s`) recompute from the record; 185's 12.00 %LEL, dI 3.00, and 24.0 min cooldown (`2820+1440=4260 s`) recompute; 186's 12.00 m, sweep 4.00, and 12.0 min survey (`6000+720=6720 s`) recompute. Raster adaptation (0.82**k plus 4% noise) and the 1.2–1.5 ms physics pairs give the 5–40 stream a raster-scale motif without violating 0.8 ms same-channel refractory.
- **Gaps, honestly:** (i) 5–40 cap still forces heavy thinning (1 Hz optode kept as 4 tau points; 1 Hz pellistor kept as 4 I points plus one I0 pair; 10 Hz FMCW chirp kept as 4 Δf points); (ii) 184's post-stop 2.40 ppm is a later sample, not a closed-loop DO controller; (iii) 185 HIL coupon times an in-service isolate that the stream does not independently witness on a second live oven until the new bead starts; (iv) no gate_snn input→output volley pair at raster resolution this round (r04-a1 already staged that).

### Training value (SNN/LSM + agentic)
Distillation targets: Stern-Volmer DO=k_sv·(τ0/τ−1) reconstruction head plus quenching and product identities; conjunctive restore-aeration floor vs continue-idle vs plant ESD; DO-infra collusion; pellistor LEL=k_p·(I−I0) head plus delta identity; isolate-floor oven vs keep-firing vs shop-trip; exoneration against last-to-badge social pressure; FMCW L=k_r·Δf and sweep identities; bounded ACCEPT with still-out-of-scope; skip-isolate refusal under survey takt. Agentic value concentrates in three patterns: reconstruction-as-SoT on a physical DO/LEL/level the raw corridor cannot see, earned ACCEPT with an explicit physical out-of-scope object (S-1..S-3), and stop-then-hold so a REJECT does not become a plant/shop/dump kill.

